  "description": "At the funeral of the self-made conglomerate Chairman Cha San-ho, his lover Noah is crying sadly. Coral's son Ji-won, who sees Noah as often as he does drugs and self-harm due to post-traumatic disorder, and Jae-yeon, the head of the bodyguard, throws an indifferent gaze. The three live together in the house of the Cha family in an unknown tension. And another man who knew Noah very well...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/polyp/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/polyp), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066872), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11900917), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260371) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_1110928)",
